          <div class="stat-label">Umsatz &middot; <span id="phInvRangeLabel">Monat</span></div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phInvRevenue">&ndash;<em>&euro;</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phInvRevenueDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">Offen</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phInvOpen">&ndash;<em>&euro;</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phInvOpenDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">&Uuml;berf&auml;llig</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phInvOverdue">&ndash;<em>&euro;</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phInvOverdueDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">&Oslash; Zahlungsdauer</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phInvAvgPay">&ndash; <em>Tage</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phInvAvgPayDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-bar">
        <div class="filter-tabs" id="phInvTabs">
          <button class="filter-tab active" data-status="all">Alle <span class="count" data-count="all">0</span></button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-status="paid">Bezahlt <span class="count" data-count="paid">0</span></button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-status="open">Offen <span class="count" data-count="open">0</span></button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-status="overdue">&Uuml;berf&auml;llig <span class="count" data-count="overdue">0</span></button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-status="draft">Entw&uuml;rfe <span class="count" data-count="draft">0</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="filter-sep"></div>
        <select class="filter-select" id="phInvRange" aria-label="Zeitraum">
          <option value="month">Zeitraum: Dieser Monat</option>
          <option value="30d">Letzte 30 Tage</option>
          <option value="quarter">Quartal</option>
          <option value="year">Dieses Jahr</option>
          <option value="all">Alle</option>
        </select>
        <select class="filter-select" id="phInvSort" aria-label="Sortierung">
          <option value="newest">Sortieren: Neueste zuerst</option>
          <option value="amount">Betrag (h&ouml;chster)</option>
          <option value="due">F&auml;lligkeit</option>
          <option value="overdue">&Uuml;berf&auml;llig (l&auml;ngste)</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="card kurse-table-wrap" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <table class="kurse-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="padding-left:20px;">Rechnungsnr.</th>
              <th>Kunde / Kurs</th>
              <th>F&auml;lligkeit</th>
              <th>Betrag</th>
              <th>Status</th>
              <th style="padding-right:20px;text-align:right;">Aktionen</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="phInvTbody">
            <tr><td colspan="6" style="padding:30px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px">L&auml;dt Rechnungen&hellip;</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- §14 UStG-Erkl&auml;rung -->
      <div class="card" style="padding:18px 22px;margin-top:18px;background:rgba(168,182,163,0.08);border-color:rgba(168,182,163,0.30);">
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
          <span style="display:inline-flex;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sage-deep,#7A8B72);color:#fff;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;">i</span>
          So funktioniert das Stornieren
        </div>
        <ul style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.65;margin:0;padding-left:18px;">
          <li><strong>Entw&uuml;rfe</strong> kannst du komplett <strong>l&ouml;schen</strong> &mdash; sie wurden ja noch nicht versendet, kein USt-Risiko.</li>
          <li><strong>Versendete oder bezahlte Rechnungen</strong> d&uuml;rfen laut <strong>&sect;14 UStG nicht gel&ouml;scht</strong> werden. Stattdessen wird beim &bdquo;Stornieren&ldquo; automatisch eine <strong>Storno-Rechnung</strong> mit negativen Betr&auml;gen und eigener fortlaufender Nummer erstellt, die auf die Original-Rechnung verweist.</li>
          <li><strong>Buchhaltung-Sync</strong> &mdash; LexOffice/sevDesk Auto-Sync ist geplant (Integrationen-Section). Bis dahin: DATEV-Export oder PDF-Download manuell verwenden.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      </div>  <!-- close .page -->
      </div>  <!-- close section -->
      <div class="section" data-section="berichte" hidden>
        <div class="page">

      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">Umsatz · Auslastung · Retention</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Deine <em class="italic">Berichte</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub" id="phBerSub">Monatliche &Uuml;bersichten, Kurs-Performance, Mom-Graph-Funnel &middot; Export als PDF oder CSV.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="window.__berichteExport('csv')">CSV</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="window.__berichteExport('pdf')">PDF</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__berichteExport('datev')">DATEV</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Period Selector -->
      <div class="period-bar">
        <div class="period-label">Zeitraum</div>
        <div class="period-controls" id="phBerPeriodTabs">
          <button class="filter-tab" data-period="today">Heute</button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-period="7d">7 Tage</button>
          <button class="filter-tab active" data-period="month">Aktueller Monat</button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-period="quarter">Quartal</button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-period="ytd">Jahr (YTD)</button>
          <button class="filter-tab" data-period="custom">Eigener Zeitraum&hellip;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="period-export" id="phBerRangeDisplay" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-2);font-family:var(--font-mono,Menlo)">
          &nbsp;
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Haupt-KPIs -->
      <div class="kpi-row" id="phBerKpiRow">
        <div class="kpi kpi-primary">
          <div class="kpi-label" id="phBerKpiUmsatzLabel">Umsatz</div>
          <div class="kpi-value" id="phBerKpiUmsatz">&mdash;<em>&euro;</em></div>
          <div class="kpi-trend" id="phBerKpiUmsatzTrend">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="kpi-bars" id="phBerKpiUmsatzBars"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-label">Auslastung</div>
          <div class="kpi-value" id="phBerKpiAuslastung">&mdash;%</div>
          <div class="kpi-trend" id="phBerKpiAuslastungTrend">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress-bar" id="phBerKpiAuslastungBar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-label">Neue Kunden</div>
          <div class="kpi-value" id="phBerKpiKunden">&mdash;</div>
          <div class="kpi-trend" id="phBerKpiKundenTrend">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-label">Stornierungen</div>
          <div class="kpi-value" id="phBerKpiStorno">&mdash;</div>
          <div class="kpi-trend" id="phBerKpiStornoTrend">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Haupt-Chart -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="table-head">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Umsatzverlauf</div>
            <div class="table-title">Täglicher <em class="italic">Umsatz</em> &middot; April 2026</div>
            <div class="section-sub">Grünes Feld = über Tagesziel von 280 €. Mom-Graph-Boost in KW 15 &amp; 16 deutlich sichtbar.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="chart-legend">
            <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--primary)"></span> Umsatz</span>
            <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--sage)"></span> Ziel</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <svg class="chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 240" preserveAspectRatio="none" id="phBerChartSvg">
          <!-- Grid -->
          <line x1="0" y1="60" x2="720" y2="60" stroke="rgba(60,33,36,0.08)" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="120" x2="720" y2="120" stroke="rgba(60,33,36,0.08)" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="180" x2="720" y2="180" stroke="rgba(60,33,36,0.08)" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
          <!-- Ziel-Linie -->
          <line x1="0" y1="135" x2="720" y2="135" stroke="#93A388" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6,6" opacity="0.6" id="phBerChartTarget"/>
          <!-- Fläche -->
          <path id="phBerChartArea" d="M0,240 L720,240 Z" fill="url(#areaGrad)" opacity="0.5"/>
          <!-- Linie -->
          <path id="phBerChartLine" d="M0,240" fill="none" stroke="#CC895E" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="areaGrad" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#CC895E" stop-opacity="0.4"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#CC895E" stop-opacity="0"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <div class="chart-axis" id="phBerChartAxis">
          <span>01</span><span>05</span><span>10</span><span>15</span><span>20</span><span>25</span><span>30</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Zwei-Spalten: Kurs-Performance + Mom-Graph-Funnel -->
      <div class="report-grid">

        <div class="card">
          <div class="table-head">
            <div>
              <div class="section-kicker">Top-Performer</div>
              <div class="table-title">Kurs-<em class="italic">Performance</em></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <table class="data-table">
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Kurs</th><th style="text-align:right">Umsatz</th><th style="text-align:right">Auslastung</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="phBerTopPerformerTbody">
              <tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:24px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Lade Kurs-Performance&hellip;</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="table-head">
            <div>
              <div class="section-kicker">Mom-Graph</div>
              <div class="table-title">Empfehlungs-<em class="italic">Funnel</em></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="funnel">
            <div class="funnel-step">
              <div class="funnel-bar" style="width:100%"><span class="funnel-count">42</span></div>
              <div class="funnel-label">Einladungen verschickt</div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step">
              <div class="funnel-bar" style="width:72%"><span class="funnel-count">30</span></div>
              <div class="funnel-label">Landing geöffnet &middot; 72%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step">
              <div class="funnel-bar" style="width:48%"><span class="funnel-count">20</span></div>
              <div class="funnel-label">Schnupper gebucht &middot; 48%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step">
              <div class="funnel-bar" style="width:33%"><span class="funnel-count">14</span></div>
              <div class="funnel-label">Konvertiert &middot; 33%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="funnel-step">
              <div class="funnel-bar success" style="width:26%"><span class="funnel-count">11</span></div>
              <div class="funnel-label">Credits ausgezahlt &middot; 26%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Bottom: Zahlungsmethoden + Stornogründe -->
      <div class="report-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="table-head">
            <div>
              <div class="section-kicker">Zahlung</div>
              <div class="table-title">Zahlungs<em class="italic">-Methoden</em></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="donut-grid" id="phBerPaymentDonut">
            <div style="padding:18px;color:var(--muted-2);font-size:13px;text-align:center">Lade…</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="table-head">
            <div>
              <div class="section-kicker">Retention</div>
              <div class="table-title">Storno-<em class="italic">Gründe</em></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="donut-grid" id="phBerCancelReasonsDonut">
            <div style="padding:18px;color:var(--muted-2);font-size:13px;text-align:center">Lade…</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <style>
      .period-bar { display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 18px; border-radius:var(--radius-lg); margin-bottom:24px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
      .period-label { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-weight:700; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted-2); }
      .period-controls { display:flex; gap:4px; flex-wrap:wrap; flex:1; }
      .period-export { display:flex; gap:6px; }

      .filter-tab { background:transparent; border:1px solid var(--border); padding:6px 12px; border-radius:var(--radius-pill); font-size:12px; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink-2); cursor:pointer; transition: all var(--motion-fast); }
      .filter-tab:hover { background:var(--surface-alt); }
      .filter-tab.active { background:var(--ink); color:var(--bg); border-color:var(--ink); }

      .kpi-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-bottom:28px; }
      .kpi { background: var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:22px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
      .kpi-primary { border-color: var(--primary); }
      .kpi-label { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-weight:700; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted-2); margin-bottom:10px; }
      .kpi-value { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-size:38px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); line-height:1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .kpi-trend { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); margin-top:10px; }
      .kpi-trend.positive { color: var(--sage-deep); }
      .kpi-bars { display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:3px; height:40px; margin-top:14px; }
      .kpi-bars span { flex:1; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--primary-soft), var(--primary)); border-radius:2px; min-height:8%; }

      .progress-wrap { height:6px; background:var(--surface-alt); border-radius:var(--radius-pill); overflow:hidden; margin-top:14px; }
      .progress-bar { height:100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-soft), var(--primary)); border-radius:var(--radius-pill); }

      .card { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:26px; margin-bottom:22px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
      .table-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px; margin-bottom:18px; }
      .section-kicker { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-weight:700; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted-2); margin-bottom:4px; }
      .table-title { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); }
      .table-title em.italic { font-family:var(--font-accent); font-style:italic; font-weight:400; color:var(--primary); }
      .section-sub { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted-2); margin-top:4px; max-width:560px; }

      .chart-legend { display:flex; gap:18px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); }
      .legend-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
      .legend-dot { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
      .chart-svg { width:100%; height:240px; display:block; }
      .chart-axis { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted-2); padding:0 6px; margin-top:6px; }

      .report-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap:18px; }

      .data-table { width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size:13px; }
      .data-table th { text-align:left; font-family:var(--font-heading); font-weight:700; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted-2); padding:10px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
      .data-table td { padding:10px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--ink); }
      .data-table td.right { text-align:right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

      .funnel { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
      .funnel-step { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
      .funnel-bar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-soft), var(--primary)); padding:8px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color:var(--bg); font-weight:600; font-size:14px; min-width:64px; }
      .funnel-bar.success { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--sage), var(--sage-deep)); }
      .funnel-count { font-family:var(--font-heading); font-weight:700; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.02em; }
      .funnel-label { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); padding-left:2px; }

      /* Marketing-Section: Mom-Graph Funnel — horizontal cards mit Arrow-Clip-Path (matches marketing-preview.html) */
      [data-section="marketing"] .funnel {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 0;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      [data-section="marketing"] .funnel-step {
        position: relative;
        padding: 16px 14px 14px 24px;
        background: var(--bg);
        margin-right: -14px;
        clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 14px) 0, 100% 50%, calc(100% - 14px) 100%, 0 100%, 14px 50%);
        display: block;
      }
      [data-section="marketing"] .funnel-step:first-child { clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 14px) 0, 100% 50%, calc(100% - 14px) 100%, 0 100%); padding-left: 18px; }
      [data-section="marketing"] .funnel-step:last-child { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%, 14px 50%); margin-right: 0; }
      [data-section="marketing"] .funnel-step.highlight { background: var(--primary-tint); }
      @media (max-width: 720px) {
        [data-section="marketing"] .funnel { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4px; padding: 6px; }
      }

      .donut-grid { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
      .donut-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr auto; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); }
      .donut-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
      .donut-dot { width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
      .right-val { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

      .btn { font-family:var(--font-body); font-weight:600; border:none; cursor:pointer; border-radius:var(--radius-pill); padding:10px 18px; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.02em; transition: all var(--motion-fast); display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
      .btn-sm { padding:7px 14px; font-size:12px; }
      .btn-primary { background:var(--primary); color:var(--bg); }
      .btn-primary:hover { background:var(--primary-hover); }
      .btn-ghost { background:transparent; color:var(--ink); border:1px solid var(--border-strong); }
      .btn-ghost:hover { background:var(--surface); }
      
/* ── Provider Postfach (3-col grid) ── */
.postfach-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 320px 1fr; gap: 0; height: calc(100vh - 280px); min-height: 540px; background: var(--surface, #FBF5EA); border: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.10)); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
.pf-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.08)); background: var(--bg, #FBF5EA); }
.pf-col:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.pf-col-head { padding: 16px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.08)); font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.pf-filters { padding: 8px 0; }
.pf-filter { padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2, #67625A); cursor: pointer; transition: background 140ms; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.pf-filter:hover { background: rgba(217,108,69,0.06); }
.pf-filter.active { background: rgba(217,108,69,0.12); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); font-weight: 600; }
.pf-filter .count { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388); background: var(--surface-alt, #EBDCC3); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; }
.pf-list { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; }
.pf-thread { padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.06); cursor: pointer; transition: background 140ms; position: relative; }
.pf-thread:hover { background: var(--surface-alt, #EBDCC3); }
.pf-thread.active { background: rgba(217,108,69,0.10); }
.pf-thread.unread::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 50%; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--apricot-deep, #D96C45); transform: translateY(-50%); }
.pf-thread-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.pf-thread-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
.pf-thread-time { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388); }
.pf-thread-subject { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); margin-bottom: 2px; font-weight: 500; }
.pf-thread-preview { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-2, #67625A); line-height: 1.45; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; }
.pf-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: 6px; }
.pf-tag.urgent { background: rgba(184,57,42,0.14); color: #B8392A; }
.pf-tag.eltern { background: rgba(168,182,163,0.30); color: #4A5546; }
.pf-tag.system { background: rgba(31,29,24,0.10); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
.pf-detail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; background: var(--bg, #FBF5EA); }
.pf-detail-head { padding: 18px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.08)); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.pf-detail-name { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
.pf-detail-name em { font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: var(--apricot-deep, #D96C45); }
.pf-detail-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388); margin-top: 2px; }
.pf-messages { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.pf-msg { max-width: 78%; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; }
.pf-msg.in { background: var(--surface-alt, #EBDCC3); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); align-self: flex-start; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }
.pf-msg.out { background: var(--ink, #1F1D18); color: var(--bg, #FBF5EA); align-self: flex-end; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
.pf-msg.system { background: rgba(168,182,163,0.20); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); align-self: center; max-width: 80%; font-size: 12.5px; }
.pf-msg-meta { font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.6; margin-top: 6px; }
.pf-reply { padding: 14px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.08)); flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--bg, #FBF5EA); }
.pf-reply textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.12); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface, #FBF5EA); font-family: inherit; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); resize: vertical; min-height: 64px; }
.pf-reply textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--apricot-deep, #D96C45); }
.pf-reply-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 10px; }
.pf-reply-meta { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388); }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .postfach-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: auto; }
  .pf-col { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(31,29,24,0.08)); max-height: 320px; }
  .pf-col:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
}

/* ============================================================
   Marketing Flow + Template Editor Modals
   ============================================================ */
.mf-backdrop {
  position: fixed; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(31, 29, 24, 0.55);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  z-index: 10000;
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;
  padding: 60px 20px 20px;
  animation: mfFadeIn 160ms ease-out;
}
@keyframes mfFadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
.mf-modal {
  background: var(--surface, #FFEFE1);
  border-radius: 16px;
  width: 100%; max-width: 640px;
  max-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(31,29,24,0.32), 0 0 0 1px rgba(31,29,24,0.06);
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  animation: mfSlideIn 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
}
@keyframes mfSlideIn { from { transform: translateY(-12px); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } }
.mf-head {
  padding: 24px 28px 14px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.08);
  position: relative;
}
.mf-kicker {
  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.mf-title {
  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  margin: 0; line-height: 1.1;
}
.mf-title em {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
}
.mf-close {
  position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 18px;
  width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px;
  border: none; background: transparent;
  font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.mf-close:hover { background: rgba(31,29,24,0.06); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
.mf-body {
  padding: 20px 28px 24px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  flex: 1;
}
.mf-row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.mf-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.mf-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted-2, #8B7E6E);
  margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;
  display: block;
}
.mf-req { color: #B4523A; }
.mf-input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.14);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #fff;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  transition: border-color 140ms ease;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.mf-input:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(204,137,94,0.18);
}
.mf-textarea {
  resize: vertical;
  min-height: 160px;
  font-family: 'Menlo', 'Consolas', monospace;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.mf-hint {
  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.45;
}
.mf-hint code {
  background: rgba(204,137,94,0.12);
  padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px;
  font-family: 'Menlo', monospace; font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
}
.mf-hint a {
  color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.mf-hint a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.mf-delay-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
.mf-vars {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: rgba(204,137,94,0.06);
  border-radius: 8px;
}
.mf-vars-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted-2, #8B7E6E);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.mf-var-chip {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 4px 9px;
  margin: 0 5px 5px 0;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.14);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #fff;
  font-family: 'Menlo', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 120ms ease;
}
.mf-var-chip:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  background: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  color: #FFEFE1;
}
.mf-foot {
  padding: 16px 28px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.08);
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  background: rgba(31,29,24,0.02);
}
.mf-foot-right { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
.mf-btn {
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: none;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 140ms ease;
}
.mf-btn-primary {
  background: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  color: #FFEFE1;
}
.mf-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-deep, #B57448); }
.mf-btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }
.mf-btn-ghost {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.14);
}
.mf-btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(31,29,24,0.06); color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .mf-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mf-modal { max-height: calc(100vh - 40px); }
  .mf-backdrop { padding: 20px 12px; }
}

/* WYSIWYG Editor — Tabs + Toolbar */
.mf-editor-tabs {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
  gap: 4px; margin: 4px 0 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.10);
  padding-bottom: 6px;
}
.mf-tab {
  padding: 6px 12px;
  background: transparent;
  border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 140ms ease;
}
.mf-tab:hover { color: var(--ink, #1F1D18); }
.mf-tab.active {
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  border-bottom-color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
}
.mf-editor-toolbar {
  display: inline-flex; flex: 1; flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 2px; margin-left: 12px;
  align-items: center;
}
.mf-tool {
  padding: 5px 10px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 100ms ease;
  min-width: 28px;
}
.mf-tool:hover {
  background: rgba(204,137,94,0.10);
  border-color: rgba(204,137,94,0.20);
}
.mf-tool strong, .mf-tool em, .mf-tool u { font-size: 13px; }
.mf-tool-sep {
  width: 1px; height: 18px;
  background: rgba(31,29,24,0.12);
  margin: 0 4px;
}

/* Rich contenteditable area */
.mf-rich-editor {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 200px;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.14);
  border-top: none;
  border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
  background: #fff;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  outline: none;
  overflow-y: auto;
  max-height: 360px;
}
.mf-rich-editor:focus {
  border-color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(204,137,94,0.18);
}
.mf-rich-editor:empty::before {
  content: attr(data-placeholder);
  color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  font-style: italic;
}
.mf-rich-editor p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
.mf-rich-editor p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.mf-rich-editor a { color: var(--primary, #CC895E); }
.mf-rich-editor ul, .mf-rich-editor ol { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 10px; }

/* Preview modal */
.mf-preview-modal { max-width: 600px; }
.mf-preview-email {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.10);
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
.mf-preview-header {
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.08);
  background: #FAFAF7;
}
.mf-preview-from {
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.mf-preview-to {
  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted, #9A9388);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.mf-preview-subj {
  font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
}
.mf-preview-body {
  padding: 22px 24px;
  font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
}
.mf-preview-body p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.mf-preview-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.mf-preview-body a { color: var(--primary, #CC895E); }
.mf-preview-body ul { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.mf-preview-chat {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #ECE5DD;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
.mf-preview-bubble {
  background: #DCF8C6;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 10px 10px 10px 2px;
  max-width: 80%;
  font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;
  color: #111;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.mf-preview-bubble p { margin: 0 0 6px; }
.mf-preview-bubble p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.mf-preview-meta {
  font-size: 11px; color: rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
  margin-top: 6px; margin-left: 4px;
}

/* ============================================================
   Embed Section
   ============================================================ */
.embed-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 18px;
}
@media (min-width: 1100px) {
  .embed-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (min-width: 1500px) {
  .embed-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
}
.embed-card .card-head {
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.embed-card .card-sub {
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted-2, #8B7E6E);
  margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.4;
}
.embed-snippet-wrap {
  margin: 12px 0 16px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
}
.embed-snippet {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.14);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(31,29,24,0.04);
  font-family: 'Menlo', 'Consolas', monospace;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--ink, #1F1D18);
  resize: vertical;
  min-height: 70px;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  word-break: break-all;
}
.embed-snippet:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--primary, #CC895E);
  background: #fff;
}
.embed-preview-wrap {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.08);
  padding-top: 14px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}
.embed-preview-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted-2, #8B7E6E);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.embed-preview {
  width: 100%; height: 360px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,29,24,0.10);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #fff;
  display: block;
}

</style>

    </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section" data-section="credits" hidden>
        <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">Credit-System &middot; Add-Up-P&auml;sse</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Credits &amp; <em>Familien-P&auml;sse</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub" id="phCreditsSub">L&auml;dt&hellip;</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="alert('Credit-Regeln folgen')">Regeln</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="alert('Credits gutschreiben folgt')">+ Credits gutschreiben</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="credit-banner">
        <div>
          <h3>Wie der <em>Credit</em> funktioniert</h3>
          <p>Eine Familie kauft z.&nbsp;B. einen 8er-Kursblock und bekommt automatisch 2 Add-Up-Credits geschenkt. Wird das Kind krank oder will sie spontan zu einem zweiten Kurs am Sa, kann sie 1 Credit einl&ouml;sen. Keine Verfallsdauer im aktiven Block. Nach Block-Ende verfallen ungenutzte Credits &mdash; au&szlig;er Familie verl&auml;ngert.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="credit-pic">
          <div class="credit-circle">C</div>
          <div class="credit-arrow">&rarr;</div>
          <div class="credit-circle outcome">1&times;<br>Add-Up</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:12px;">Credit-<em class="italic-accent" style="color:var(--primary);">Verlauf</em></h2>
      <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <table class="kurse-table">
          <thead><tr><th style="padding-left:20px;">Familie</th><th>Aktion</th><th>Credits</th><th>Datum</th><th style="padding-right:20px;text-align:right;">Status</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="phCreditsTbody"><tr><td colspan="5" style="padding:30px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px">L&auml;dt&hellip;</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      </div>  <!-- close .page -->
      </div>  <!-- close section -->
      <div class="section" data-section="anwesenheit" hidden>
        <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">Anwesenheit &middot; Echtzeit-Tracking</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Anwesenheits-<em>Tracking</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub" id="phAttSub">L&auml;dt&hellip;</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="alert('CSV-Export folgt')">Export &middot; CSV</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.__openQrCheckin()">QR-Check-In</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats" style="margin-bottom:22px;">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label" id="phAttHeuteLabel">Heute</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phAttKurseHeute">&ndash; <em>Kurse</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phAttKurseDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">Anwesend &middot; jetzt</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phAttAnwesend">&ndash;</div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phAttQuote">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">Krank gemeldet</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phAttKrank">&ndash;</div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phAttKrankDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-label">No-Shows &middot; 30d</div>
          <div class="stat-value" id="phAttNoShow">&ndash; <em>%</em></div>
          <div class="stat-delta" id="phAttNoShowDelta">&nbsp;</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="att-toolbar">
        <div class="att-date-pick" id="phAttDatePicker">
          <div class="date-arrow" id="phAttPrev" style="cursor:pointer">&larr;</div>
          <div>
            <div class="date" id="phAttDate">L&auml;dt&hellip;</div>
            <div id="phAttDateMeta" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-2);margin-top:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="date-arrow" id="phAttNext" style="cursor:pointer">&rarr;</div>
        </div>
        <div class="att-quick">
          <span class="quick" data-when="yesterday">Gestern</span>
          <span class="quick active" data-when="today">Heute</span>
          <span class="quick" data-when="tomorrow">Morgen</span>
          <span class="quick" data-when="week">Diese Woche</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="att-class-list" id="phAttClassList">
        <div style="padding:40px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px">L&auml;dt Anwesenheit&hellip;</div>
      </div>

      </div>  <!-- close .page -->
      </div>  <!-- close section -->
      <div class="section" data-section="raeume" hidden>
        <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker" id="phRoomsKicker">&nbsp;</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">R&auml;ume &amp; <em>Verf&uuml;gbarkeit</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub" id="phRoomsSub">L&auml;dt&hellip;</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="window.__openBelegungsplan()">Belegungsplan</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.__roomOpen(null)">+ Neuer Raum</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats" style="margin-bottom:22px;">
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">R&auml;ume aktiv</div><div class="stat-value" id="phRoomsActive">&ndash;</div><div class="stat-delta" id="phRoomsActiveDelta">&nbsp;</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Auslastung &middot; &Oslash;</div><div class="stat-value" id="phRoomsUtil">&ndash; <em>%</em></div><div class="stat-delta">&nbsp;</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Kollisionen verhindert &middot; 30d</div><div class="stat-value" id="phRoomsConflicts">&ndash;</div><div class="stat-delta">Auto-Blocks beim Anlegen</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Buchungen heute</div><div class="stat-value" id="phRoomsTodayBookings">&ndash;</div><div class="stat-delta">&nbsp;</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="block-grid" id="phRoomsGrid">
        <div style="grid-column:1/-1;padding:40px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px">L&auml;dt R&auml;ume&hellip;</div>
      </div>

      </div>  <!-- close .page -->
      </div>  <!-- close section -->
      <div class="section" data-section="ferien" hidden>
        <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">Feiertage &middot; Pausen &middot; Saisons</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Ferien &amp; <em class="italic">Saisons</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub" id="phFerienSub">L&auml;dt&hellip;</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.__openNewBreakModal()">+ Neue Pause</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card" id="phFerienHero">
        <div class="hero-left">
          <div class="section-kicker">Aktueller Status</div>
          <h2 class="hero-title">L&auml;dt&hellip;</h2>
          <p class="hero-sub" id="phFerienHeroSub">&nbsp;</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kpi-row">
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Feiertage <span id="phFerienYear">2026</span></div><div class="kpi-value" id="phFerienHolidays">&ndash;</div><div class="kpi-trend" id="phFerienBundesland">automatisch</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Eigene Pausen</div><div class="kpi-value" id="phFerienOwnBreaks">&ndash;</div><div class="kpi-trend">&nbsp;</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">N&auml;chste Schlie&szlig;ung in</div><div class="kpi-value" id="phFerienNextDays">&ndash;</div><div class="kpi-trend" id="phFerienNextLabel">&nbsp;</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">Betroffene Buchungen</div><div class="kpi-value" id="phFerienAffected">&ndash;</div><div class="kpi-trend">in n&auml;chster Schlie&szlig;ung</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;margin-top:22px;">
        <table class="kurse-table">
          <thead><tr><th style="padding-left:20px;">Datum</th><th>Anlass</th><th>Typ</th><th>Status</th><th style="padding-right:20px;text-align:right;">Aktion</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="phFerienTbody"><tr><td colspan="5" style="padding:30px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px">L&auml;dt Ferientage&hellip;</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      </div>  <!-- close .page -->
      </div>  <!-- close section -->
      <div class="section" data-section="embed" hidden>
        <div class="page">

          <div class="page-head">
            <div class="page-head-text">
              <div class="page-kicker">Distribution &middot; Public Widgets</div>
              <h1 class="page-title">Auf deiner <em>Website</em></h1>
              <p class="page-sub">Zeig deine Kurse direkt auf deiner Webseite. Kopier den Snippet unten und füg ihn in dein Theme/Editor ein. Buchungen laufen ohne Weiterleitung — direkt im iFrame.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- URL Snapshot -->
          <div class="card" id="phEmbedSlugCard" style="margin-bottom:18px">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2)">Dein Provider-Slug</div>
                <div id="phEmbedSlugText" style="font-family:'Menlo',monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-top:4px">—</div>
                <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">Wird in jeder Embed-URL und im Eltern-Portal genutzt.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center">
                <a id="phEmbedPortalLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Eltern-Portal &rarr;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Three embed options -->
          <div class="embed-grid" id="phEmbedGrid">
            <!-- KALENDER -->
            <div class="card embed-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div>
                  <div class="card-title">Kurs<em>kalender</em></div>
                  <div class="card-sub">Monatsansicht mit klickbaren Tagen — perfekt für deine Startseite</div>
                </div>
                <a class="card-link" id="phEmbedCalOpen" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Im neuen Tab &rarr;</a>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-snippet-wrap">
                <textarea readonly class="embed-snippet" id="phEmbedCalSnippet"></textarea>
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__embCopy('phEmbedCalSnippet', this)">Snippet kopieren</button>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-preview-wrap">
                <div class="embed-preview-label">Live-Vorschau</div>
                <iframe id="phEmbedCalPreview" class="embed-preview" loading="lazy" title="Kalender-Vorschau"></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- KURSE LISTE -->
            <div class="card embed-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div>
                  <div class="card-title">Kurs<em>liste</em></div>
                  <div class="card-sub">Alle aktiven Kurse als Karten-Grid mit Buchen-Button</div>
                </div>
                <a class="card-link" id="phEmbedCoursesOpen" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Im neuen Tab &rarr;</a>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-snippet-wrap">
                <textarea readonly class="embed-snippet" id="phEmbedCoursesSnippet"></textarea>
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__embCopy('phEmbedCoursesSnippet', this)">Snippet kopieren</button>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-preview-wrap">
                <div class="embed-preview-label">Live-Vorschau</div>
                <iframe id="phEmbedCoursesPreview" class="embed-preview" loading="lazy" title="Kurs-Liste-Vorschau"></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- EINZELKURS -->
            <div class="card embed-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div>
                  <div class="card-title">Einzel<em>kurs</em></div>
                  <div class="card-sub">Ein spezifischer Kurs mit Detail-Ansicht und direkter Buchung</div>
                </div>
                <a class="card-link" id="phEmbedSingleOpen" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Im neuen Tab &rarr;</a>
              </div>
              <div style="margin:12px 0">
                <label style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:6px">Kurs auswählen</label>
                <select id="phEmbedSingleSelect" class="mf-input" onchange="window.__embRefreshSingle()"></select>
                <div id="phEmbedSingleHint" style="display:none;margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(204,137,94,0.08);border-radius:6px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);line-height:1.4"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-snippet-wrap">
                <textarea readonly class="embed-snippet" id="phEmbedSingleSnippet"></textarea>
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__embCopy('phEmbedSingleSnippet', this)">Snippet kopieren</button>
              </div>
              <div class="embed-preview-wrap">
                <div class="embed-preview-label">Live-Vorschau</div>
                <iframe id="phEmbedSinglePreview" class="embed-preview" loading="lazy" title="Einzelkurs-Vorschau"></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hilfe-Card -->
          <div class="card" style="margin-top:22px">
            <div class="card-head">
              <div class="card-title">So <em>baust</em> du es ein</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px;padding-top:8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:6px">WordPress / Elementor</div>
                <div style="color:var(--ink)">In den Editor → "HTML"-Block einfügen → Snippet pasten → Speichern.</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:6px">Webflow / Wix / Squarespace</div>
                <div style="color:var(--ink)">"Embed Code"-Element einfügen → Snippet pasten → Veröffentlichen.</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:6px">Eigenes HTML</div>
                <div style="color:var(--ink)">Snippet einfach in deine HTML-Datei kopieren — funktioniert ohne weitere Konfiguration.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Conversion-Tracking Card -->
          <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
            <div class="card-head">
              <div>
                <div class="card-title">Conversion-<em>Tracking</em></div>
                <div class="card-sub">Wenn du Pixel auf deiner Website hast (GTM / GA4 / Meta), leitet dieser Listener Buchungs-Events aus dem iFrame an deine Pixel weiter. Für Server-Side-Tracking (CAPI / Measurement Protocol) → siehe <a href="#integrationen" onclick="window.showSection('integrationen');return false" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline">Integrationen</a>.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;background:rgba(204,137,94,0.06);border-radius:10px">
              <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:4px">Conversion-Listener</div>
              <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted-2);line-height:1.5">Snippet einmal in den <code style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.06);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px">&lt;head&gt;</code> deiner Website einfügen — funktioniert mit GTM, GA4 (gtag) und Meta Pixel gleichzeitig. Ungenutzte Pixel werden ignoriert.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:14px">
              <textarea readonly class="embed-snippet" id="phEmbedTrackSnippet" style="min-height:200px"></textarea>
              <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__embCopy('phEmbedTrackSnippet', this)">Listener kopieren</button>
                <span style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2)">Pixel selbst vorher in GA4 / Meta Business / GTM anlegen.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Was wird gesendet -->
            <div style="margin-top:18px">
              <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:6px">Was im Event drinsteht</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6">
                <ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted-2);font-size:12.5px">
                  <li><code>type</code>: <code>"ukc-booking-success"</code></li>
                  <li><code>provider</code>: dein Slug (<code>socialy</code>)</li>
                  <li><code>bookingId</code>, <code>activityId</code>, <code>sessionId</code></li>
                  <li><code>amount</code>, <code>currency</code> — bei Online-Zahlung</li>
                  <li><code>utm_source</code>, <code>utm_medium</code>, <code>utm_campaign</code> — durchgereicht aus iFrame-URL</li>
                  <li><code>timestamp</code></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section" data-section="marketing" hidden>
        <div class="page">

      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">Wachstum &middot; Mom-Graph Q2/2026</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Eltern werben <em>Eltern</em></h1>
          <p class="page-sub">Deine Community wächst über Empfehlungen. Hier siehst du, wer bringt, was bringt und wann Credits ausgezahlt werden — und stellst Email-Automationen ein.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Einstellungen</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="event.preventDefault();return false;" style="cursor:default">Affiliate-Config</button>
        </div>
