      <div class="section" data-section="integrationen" hidden>
        <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head">
        <div class="page-head-text">
          <div class="page-kicker">App-Marketplace · 16 Apps verfügbar</div>
          <h1 class="page-title"><em>Integrationen</em> &amp; APIs</h1>
          <p class="page-sub">Verbinde Urban Kids Club mit deinem bestehenden Stack. Buchhaltung exportiert automatisch, Newsletter-Listen syncen sich, Zahlungen kommen direkt rein.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">API-Docs</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary">+ Webhook</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Conversion-Webhook Card (LIVE — n8n / Zapier / Make / eigener Endpoint) -->
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div>
            <div class="card-title">Conversion-<em>Webhook</em> <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);background:rgba(204,137,94,0.12);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle">LIVE</span></div>
            <div class="card-sub">Server-Side-Tracking für Meta CAPI / Google Ads / GA4 Measurement Protocol. Bei jeder bestätigten oder bezahlten Buchung sendet UKC ein Event mit gehashten Identifiern an deinen Endpoint (n8n, Zapier, Make oder eigener Server). Funktioniert auch bei Vor-Ort-Bezahlung.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px">
          <div>
            <label style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px">Webhook-URL</label>
            <input id="phIntegConvUrl" type="url" class="mf-input" style="width:100%;padding:10px 12px" placeholder="https://n8n.calees.de/webhook/ukc-conversion" />
            <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);margin-top:4px">UKC POSTet das Event-Payload (JSON) an diese URL. Empfohlen: HTTPS-Endpoint mit Signatur-Verifikation.</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px">HMAC-Secret <span style="color:var(--muted-2);font-weight:400">(optional, empfohlen)</span></label>
            <input id="phIntegConvSecret" type="text" class="mf-input" style="width:100%;padding:10px 12px;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px" placeholder="z.B. eigenes Secret — wird als X-UKC-Signature Header mitgegeben" />
            <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);margin-top:4px">UKC signiert jede Request mit HMAC-SHA256 → in deinem Endpoint kannst du verifizieren dass das Event echt von UKC kommt.</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px">Events</label>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)">
              <label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="phIntegConvEvtBC" checked> <code style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11.5px">booking_confirmed</code></label>
              <label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="phIntegConvEvtPR" checked> <code style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11.5px">payment_received</code></label>
              <label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="phIntegConvEvtRF"> <code style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11.5px">refund</code></label>
              <label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="phIntegConvEvtSU"> <code style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11.5px">customer_signup</code></label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="window.__intgConvSave()">Speichern</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="window.__intgConvTest()">Test-Event senden</button>
            <span id="phIntegConvStatus" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-2)"></span>
          </div>

          <details style="margin-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:14px">
            <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">Was wird gesendet? <span style="color:var(--muted-2);font-weight:400">— Payload-Schema</span></summary>
            <pre id="phIntegConvSchema" style="margin-top:10px;background:#1a1612;color:#fbf5ea;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre-wrap"></pre>
            <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5">
              <strong>SHA256-Hashes</strong> sind Meta-CAPI- und GA4-MP-konform — direkt 1:1 in die jeweilige API durchschleifbar.
              <code>event_id</code> dient als Dedup-Key zwischen Server-Event und Browser-Pixel (gleich gesetzt im iFrame postMessage).
              <code>fbp</code> / <code>fbc</code> / <code>gclid</code> werden aus der Buchungs-Session übernommen falls verfügbar.
            </div>
          </details>

          <div id="phIntegConvDeliveries" style="margin-top:6px"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="int-tabs">
